<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>NEXTMART - Top Up Digital</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f4f6fa;color:#17233d}
header{background:#101d3b;color:white;padding:22px 18px}
.logo{font-size:25px;font-weight:bold;color:#ff9d32}
header p{margin:7px 0 0;color:#dce4f5}
main{max-width:650px;margin:auto;padding:20px}
.hero{background:#172c55;color:white;padding:25px;border-radius:16px}
.hero h2{margin-top:0}
.hero p{color:#dce4f5}
h3{margin-top:26px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px}
.item{background:white;padding:20px 12px;border-radius:13px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;box-shadow:0 2px 8px #0000000b}
.item span{display:block;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:8px}
.note{background:#fff2df;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;color:#754500;font-size:13px;margin-top:20px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:25px;color:#78839a;font-size:13px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="logo">NEXTMART</div>
<p>Everything You Need, One Place.</p>
</header>
<main>
<section class="hero">
<h2>Top Up Digital Lebih Mudah!</h2>
<p>Penuhi kebutuhan digitalmu dengan NEXTMART.</p>
</section>
<h3>Pilih Layanan</h3>
<div class="grid">
<div class="item"><span>📱</span>Pulsa</div>
<div class="item"><span>🌐</span>Paket Data</div>
<div class="item"><span>⚡</span>Token PLN</div>
<div class="item"><span>💳</span>E-Wallet</div>
<div class="item"><span>🎮</span>Voucher Game</div>
<div class="item"><span>🧾</span>Pembayaran</div>
</div>
<div class="note">
<strong>Informasi:</strong> NEXTMART sedang dalam tahap pengembangan. Transaksi belum tersedia.
</div>
</main>
<footer>© 2026 NEXTMART. All Rights Reserved.</footer>
</body>
</html>
